16c25286" :question/math-academy-id "q-147068"] ["question-c76e6329-2e41-5111-9e2f-17e316c25286" :question/problem "When a coin was tossed $14$ times, $\\frac{4}{7}$ of the tosses landed heads up. How many times did it come up with tails?"] ["question-c76e6329-2e41-5111-9e2f-17e316c25286" :question/worked-solution "We are given that the ratio of heads to the total number of tosses is $\\frac{4}{7}.$ \n\nIn this fraction, the numerator represents the number of heads, and the denominator represents the total number of tosses.\n\nWe can make a denominator of $14$ by multiplying the numerator and denominator by $2:$\n\n$$\n\\frac{4\\times 2}{7\\times 2}=\\frac{8}{14}\n$$\n\nTherefore, it came up with heads $8$ times. \nSo, the number of tails is\n\n$$\n14-8=6.\n$$"] ["question-c76e6329-2e41-5111-9e2f-17e316c25286" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-966de87a-ff5f-5fa4-bf5e-d284c88f29c3" :answer-field/id #uuid "966de87a-ff5f-5fa4-bf5e-d284c88f29c3"] ["answer-a9731800-5367-5e28-80f3-4e20f6f073f0" :answer/id #uuid "a9731800-5367-5e28-80f3-4e20f6f073f0"] ["answer-a9731800-5367-5e28-80f3-4e20f6f073f0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-a9731800-5367-5e28-80f3-4e20f6f073f0" :answer/value "5"] ["answer-272d75fc-e799-5943-a491-5147b2314566" :answer/id #uuid "272d75fc-e799-5943-a491-5147b2314566"] ["answer-272d75fc-e799-5943-a491-5147b2314566" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-272d75fc-e799-5943-a491-5147b2314566" :answer/value "6"] ["answer-b44cf978-f362-5a6b-b58a-dc40ec7cde68" :answer/id #uuid "b44cf978-f362-5a6b-b58a-dc40ec7cde68"] ["answer-b44cf978-f362-5a6b-b58a-dc40ec7cde68" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-b44cf978-f362-5a6b-b58a-dc40ec7cde68" :answer/value "7"] ["answer-4ea822fe-d540-5f52-95cf-b0c6ea76fb31" :answer/id #uuid "4ea822fe-d540-5f52-95cf-b0c6ea76fb31"] ["answer-4ea822fe-d540-5f52-95cf-b0c6ea76fb31" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-4ea822fe-d540-5f52-95cf-b0c6ea76fb31" :answer/value "8"] ["answer-01259